## Trust order for decisions

user instructions > gates/verifier feedback > handoff packets > memory > guesses.

## Safety rules

- Read-only by default. Writes need an allowlisted root and a confirm token.
- No `sudo`, no service restarts, no destructive git operations.
- Never delete or overwrite an original; work on a `-patch` / `-eosfix` copy
  and keep a backup.
- Scan before sharing: `<bin> scan secrets .` (masked).
- Never encode engine submissions in the body when the report contract forbids them.
